        <activityName xml:lang="en">Chemical plant, organics</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Chemical plant, organics
na;
Synonyms: Chemiewerk, Chemiefabrik, chemical site; 
UUID: 13ed4fe0-7ba5-3b60-82b6-a63918ee814d
This process includes land use, buildings and facilities (inkl. demanteling) of an average chemical plant.; Geography: estimation, based on data from two german chemical plant sites
Location:  estimation, based on data from two german chemical plant sites
Technology: Based on informations from two chemical plant sites in Germany and their respective pictures, estimations about occupation of area are made. The weight of the facilities is based on personal information from one of these sites and on literature.
Time period: estimation, based on information from 2002
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_13ed4fe0-7ba5-3b60-82b6-a63918ee814d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
